  "implementation": "Optional DATUM_RESOURCE_TRACE samples existing CPU scope/cache/document views, GUI RSS and local reservation budgets on existing event-loop turns and host lifecycle changes. Stable budget IDs deduplicate shared budgets across renderer replacement. Observers retain only existing budget metadata, never GPU objects; closed owners remain observable until zero is reported. Final output follows App teardown. No timer or redraw added. Snapshot/host capacity exhaustion and existing output files fail explicitly.",
